   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "By the product rule, \\( g'(x) = f(x) + x f'(x) \\), and differentiating again, \\( g''(x) = 2 f'(x) + x f''(x) \\).",
         "mathjson": 1
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "At \\( x = 1 \\): \\( g(1) = 2 \\), \\( g'(1) = 1 \\), \\( g''(1) = 1 \\).",
         "mathjson": 1
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Divide by the factorials: the coefficients are \\( 2 \\), \\( 1 \\), and \\( \\frac{1}{2!} = \\frac{1}{2} \\).",
